    "attributes": {
        "action": "Authorise the full transfer of the Mineworkers' Pension Scheme Guarantor's Fund",
        "additional_details": "In the 2026 Budget speech, the Chancellor promised to ensure the full transfer of the Guarantor's Fund. The written Budget Report commits only to working towards it. We call upon the Government to authorise the immediate full transfer of the Mineworkers' Pension Scheme Guarantor's Fund so it can increase pensions for members and their dependants and to publish a firm timetable for completing the transfer and paying the additional pensions.",
